From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 18:55:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] stm32mp2: enable PSCI CPU_ON in MP257 DK USB firmware

This Buildroot configuration is specific to STM32MP257F-DK, whose TF-A
topology exposes two Cortex-A35 cores. Include the normal STM32MP2 PSCI
power-management sources in the USB-programmer BL31 too, because this
test flow boots Linux from the USB-programmer firmware context.

Do not compile the USB programmer BL31 with null PSCI platform hooks and
do not reject PSCI CPU_ON for the secondary A35 from the generic
single-core check in this image; the Linux DT and platform topology both
describe the second core.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@local>
---
